/Title (But the problem at that time was that I only knew some of the AI vocabulary: RAG, MCP, reinforcement learning, supervised fine-tuning, prompting, and some of the mathematics and coding behind them. I could follow conversations about AI systems, understand their architecture, and build applications around existing models. But I was still far from having the engineering depth I wanted.)
