/Title (ChatGPT helped write the formal prose. The research direction, reading, architectural ideas, and work behind the paper were mine. I revised substantial sections myself, but I did not independently produce every sentence. I would rather be explicit about that than present the document as a thing it wasn't.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1320 0 R
